# D23: a `throws` call as a MATCH-ARM TAIL value (match-as-expression) in a
# non-propagating context is unhandled. Pre-D23 leaked `found `Result[` (a noisy
# cascade). Now: E_UnhandledThrows, no desugar leak.
int risky() throws String:
    throw "boom"

void main():
    int n = match 1:
        case 0:
            0
        else:
            risky()
    print(n)
